<title>ISRAEL: Elbit gets Romania contracts.</title>
<headline>Elbit gets Romania contracts.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elbit Ltd has signed and expanded contracts totalling $135 million for upgrading helicopters and aircrafts for the Romanian Ministry of National Defence, the Israeli company said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The first contract, signed with the Romanian Helicopter Industry, is for the upgrade of helicopters for the Romanian Air Force.</p>
</text>
